    "text": "The set of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is a purely imaginary number, for all <math><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi></math> satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, is :"
